            "review_title": "Review at Hotpot Story Restaurant",
            "review_text": "ngannina\nRome, Italy254 contributions\n0\nA little pricey\nDec 2018 • Couples\nWe came here on a rainy day and there wasn’t any parking for our car. It was very very cold that day and every time a new customer came the cold air entered and we were the nearest table to the door. It was not a very pleasant feeling even if this was not anyone’s fault. \nThe food was fresh and I liked it a lot. However I feel that it was pricey even if we booked in advance and got 10% discount. I would recommend the tangy and a little spicy Thai broth with beaten egg, it’s lighter than the usual Thai broth yet very flavorful. The Sichuan broth wasn’t very spicy and it wasn’t up to my expectation. They did not bring out any mushrooms for us unless we asked them too. \nWe paid almost 300,000vnd with the 10% discount.\nRead more\nWritten January 17, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
