            "review_title": "Review at Hotpot Story Restaurant",
            "review_text": "ZHANG96\nSingapore, Singapore54 contributions\n0\nWow Vietnamese buffet hotpot\nJan 2016 • Couples\nWe find this hotpot buffet restaurant in the Internet with good reviews. The price only VND255,000 per pax and you get to eat as much as you can for all the seafood and meats etc available on buffet menu. There are also many cooked food like clam fried with chili, fried honey chicken wings, soup of the day, sushi, salad and roasted meat available as well plus some local dessert and ice cream. All the food are very fresh and nice and service is good as they have many waitress available to help you. It is very nice to eat hotpot in winter time so the restaurant is fully booked at dinner time. Therefore if you want to come make sure u make a reservation earlier don't come without reservation you will end up having to wait for 1-2 hours for sure. There isn't many restaurants having buffet hotpot in this style as it is come with very good service and not forgetting the special Thai chili sauce to go with. Price are reasonable as you get to eat as much as you could!\nRead more\nWritten January 2, 2016",
